MrDj9":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_Image1.jpg","title":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","text":"<h3>The Perfect Nightlights<\/h3><p>These are great night lights. Love that they offer a dimmer slide on them to control brightness and they look very nice throughout our home. The color is very nice, the size is perfect and they aren't heavy in weight, but don't feel cheap at all. The price point is perfect.<br\/>We have had them for a few weeks and they seem very durable and function quite well in our main living room and hallways.<br\/>We have had nightlights since our 11 year old was just a baby and now that she is almost a teen, the sophisticated look that these provide are great and still serve the purpose they were created for, to provide light. We love having them for sleepovers for her friends, so no one is stumbling around in the dark looking for the bathroom or the stairs. Highly recommend.<\/p><p><strong>- Jacob C.<\/strong><\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_JWe3FX":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_Image3.jpg","title":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","text":"<h3>Nice Upgrade for Decor Lighting<\/h3><p>I like how I can change the strength of the light. Good for bathrooms, kitchens, etc. sometimes you just don’t want bright light when walking into the bathroom and this can give you a good lighting that doesn’t hurt your eyes.<\/p><p><strong>- Shirley R.<\/strong><\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"column_EjHHAp":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Testimonial_Image2.jpg","title":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","text":"<h3>Home Elevation - Check!<\/h3><p>I am in LOVE with these nightlights! I have purchased 6 in total. I love the ‘spotlight’ look and how they nicely light up the hallway, bathroom, and kitchen for when anyone needs to get up at night. I love the dimming feature. I wish I could make them a bit warmer, but love them nonetheless! I love how they automatically turn on when it gets dark\/dim. My sons all love them too. The price is amazing! The size doesn’t prevent you from plugging in something else into the outlet which is so great! Highly recommend!<\/p><p><strong>- Mary H.<\/strong><\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["column_dMrDj9","column_JWe3FX","column_EjHHAp"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.multicolumn.presets.name","settings":{"title":"A Game-Changer for Your Home!","heading_size":"h1","heading_center":"center","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"portrait","columns_desktop":3,"column_alignment":"center","background_style":"primary","button_label":"","button_link":"","color_scheme":"","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"navigation_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_EX7xiA":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_BGdhLh":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Light Up Your Creativity with the LED Note Board","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_tNwdzF":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Unleash your creativity with our LED Note Board! Perfect for writing, doodling, and leaving fun messages, this board comes with vibrant LED lighting that makes your words and artwork shine. Whether you're at home, in the office, or as a unique gift idea, the LED Note Board is an interactive and stylish way to express yourself. It includes a set of colorful pens to get you started right away!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_JQVkEK":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/trendora™-led-note-board","button_style_secondary":false}}},"block_order":["heading_BGdhLh","text_tNwdzF","button_JQVkEK"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/i1_f0348dd0-9480-48be-b4e2-974c49efa364.webp","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"center","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"center","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_THFD4m":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_xTFPVD":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Add Fun and Light to Your Space with the LED Note Board","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_97fDdB":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Brighten up any space with this fun LED Note Board! Perfect for writing, drawing, and leaving glowing messages. A unique gift for everyone, adding creativity and light to your day!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_4QzVBJ":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/trendora™-led-note-board","button_style_secondary":false}}},"block_order":["heading_xTFPVD","text_97fDdB","button_4QzVBJ"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/i2_38b7232c-1577-43b6-a598-12aca039ab85.webp","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"center","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"center","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_rQYqLd":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_t6eNdG":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Fun and Bright LED Drawing Board for Kids","heading_size":"h1"}},"text_czyBL4":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Let your creativity shine with the LED Drawing Board! Perfect for kids, this fun board lights up as you draw, write, and create colorful designs. With easy-to-use markers and a glowing surface, it’s the ultimate way to express yourself and bring your artwork to life. A great gift for young artists, bringing endless fun and creativity to any room!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_cJFrfQ":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Shop Now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/trendora™-led-note-board","button_style_se